{"prefectureId":"06","cities":{"06201":[{"id":"06201:national:0a3304b08003","cityId":"06201","category":"地理・自然","text":"山形市では行政上、市内を30の地区に分けています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111221544"},{"id":"06201:national:e06f6cc7e296","cityId":"06201","category":"地理・自然","text":"市の東部は奥羽山脈による山岳地帯、南西部は丘陵が占めています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111221544"},{"id":"06201:national:1b318faa3b52","cityId":"06201","category":"歴史","text":"山形市西部の須川沿いの船町は、最上川水運において、中流域で有数の港でした。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111221544"}],"06202":[{"id":"06202:national:f3468a9ca97c","cityId":"06202","category":"文化・名所","text":"「一ノ坂遺跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/324"},{"id":"06202:national:f01babb47fd2","cityId":"06202","category":"地理・自然","text":"米沢市には吾妻連峰があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B1%B3%E6%B2%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111374780"},{"id":"06202:national:e7d7b3a7f660","cityId":"06202","category":"地域","text":"米沢市は、山形県の置賜地方に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B1%B3%E6%B2%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111374780"}],"06203":[{"id":"06203:national:5dea62983943","cityId":"06203","category":"文化・名所","text":"市域全体で庄内方言（庄内弁）が話される。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B6%B4%E5%B2%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111342648"},{"id":"06203:national:dcd33ed247fd","cityId":"06203","category":"文化・名所","text":"鶴岡市は国際会議観光都市に指定されています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B6%B4%E5%B2%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111342648"},{"id":"06203:national:db448c2acc5b","cityId":"06203","category":"地理・自然","text":"鶴岡市は全国有数の稲作地帯でもある庄内平野の南部に位置し、西側は日本海に面する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B6%B4%E5%B2%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111342648"}],"06204":[{"id":"06204:national:f308648f6933","cityId":"06204","category":"地理・自然","text":"酒田市には鳥海山があります。","source":"http