,"text":"金山町は、古来より出羽国を繋ぐ重要な場所でした。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%BA+%28%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E7%9C%8C%29&oldid=110466546"},{"id":"06361:national:586127be04f3","cityId":"06361","category":"地域","text":"金山町は、山形県の北東部にある町で、最上郡に属する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%BA+%28%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E7%9C%8C%29&oldid=110466546"}],"06362":[{"id":"06362:national:a8866685394b","cityId":"06362","category":"地理・自然","text":"最上町には神室連峰があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%80%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%BA&oldid=110255650"},{"id":"06362:national:ac254a89e59b","cityId":"06362","category":"地理・自然","text":"最上町には鳥出川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%80%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%BA&oldid=110255650"},{"id":"06362:national:4aaf1f769917","cityId":"06362","category":"地域","text":"最上町は、山形県北東部にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%80%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%BA&oldid=110255650"}],"06363":[{"id":"06363:national:f808f1a38d94","cityId":"06363","category":"地理・自然","text":"舟形町には最上川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%88%9F%E5%BD%A2%E7%94%BA&oldid=110796878"},{"id":"06363:national:4a4c80eac92a","cityId":"06363","category":"地理・自然","text":"舟形町には最上小国川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%88%9F%E5%BD%A2%E7%94%BA&oldid=110796878"},{"id":"06363:national:fdc71780f9b3","cityId":"06363","category":"歴史","text":"舟形町が初めて歴史に登場するのは、8世紀に行われた大野東人の東征です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%88%9F%E5%BD%A2%E7%94%BA&oldid=110796878"}],"06364":[{"id":"06364:national:60b1a3400855","cityId":"06364","category":"地理・自然","text":"真室川町の南部では鮭川と真室川が合流します。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%A4%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA&oldid=111373820"}],"06365":[{"id":"06365:national:56c0929a5ad3","cityId":"06365","category":"地理・自然","text":"大蔵村には最上川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E8%94%B5%E6%9D%91&oldid=109748837"},{"id":"06365:national:55048f666023","cityId":"06365","category":"地理・自然","text":"大蔵村には銅山川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E8%94%B5%E6%9D%91&oldid=109748837"}],"06366":[{"id":"06366:national:b7eb17bd6a2e","cityId":"06366","category":"地理・自然","text":"鮭川村には大芦沢山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AE%AD%E5%B7%9D%E6%9D%91&oldid=110801141"},{"id":"06366:national:5d8eb5987535","cityId":"06366","category":"地理・自然","text":"鮭川村には道ヶ峰山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AE%AD%E5%B7%9D%E6%9D%91&oldid=110801141"},{"id":"06366:national:3ba917df73f2","cityId":"06366","category":"地域","text":"鮭川村は、山形県内陸部北部にある村です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AE%AD%E5%B7%9D%E6%9D%91&oldid=110801141"}],"06367":[{"id":"06367:national:a07ec80b22fb","cityId":"06367","category":"地理・自然","text":"村の西側は出羽山地、東側は新庄盆地で、村の中央を最上川が西進する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B8%E6%B2%A2%E6%9D%91&oldid=109483519"},{"id":"06367:national:2121efc6d500","cityId":"06367","category":"地理・自然","text":"戸沢村には火打岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B8%E6%B2%A2%E6%9D%91&oldid=109483519"},{"id":"06367:national:a0c79ffda12d","cityId":"06367","category":"歴史","text":"戸沢村は、最上川とともにあった村でした。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B8%E6%B2%A2%E6%9D%91&oldid=109483519"},{"id":"06367:national:1b051aafa1a8","cityId":"06367","category":"歴史","text":"戸沢村が最初に歴史に登場するのは、延喜式の兵部省「諸国駅伝馬条」です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B8%E6%B2%A2%E6%9D%91&oldid=109483519"},{"id":"06367:national:389239dfb534","cityId":"06367","category":"地域","text":"戸沢村は、山形県最上郡にある村です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B8%E6%B2%A2%E6%9D%91&oldid=109483519"}],"06381":[{"id":"06381:national:d099c7f05b3e","cityId":"06381","category":"文化・名所","text":"「一の沢洞窟」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/313"},{"id":"06381:national:e692816fd38c","cityId":"06381","category":"地理・自然","text":"高畠町には奥羽山脈があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%98%E7%95%A0%E7%94%BA&oldid=110829344"},{"id":"06381:national:63dd3416ca6b","cityId":"06381","category":"地理・自然","text":"高畠町には最上川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%98%E7%95%A0%E7%94%BA&oldid=110829344"}],"06382":[{"id":"06382:national:52613b76f6c8","cityId":"06382","category":"地理・自然","text":"町内には犬川、黒川、元宿川、誕生川が流れ、いずれも蛇行の著しい松川と合流する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B7%9D%E8%A5%BF%E7%94%BA+%28%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E7%9C%8C%29&oldid=110468241"},{"id":"06382:national:494d11419ee0","cityId":"06382","category":"地理・自然","text":"川西町には最上川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B7%9D%E8%A5%BF%E7%94%BA+%28%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E7%9C%8C%29&oldid=110468241"}],"06401":[{"id":"06401:national:fca64be7c034","cityId":"06401","category":"地域","text":"小国町には横根スキー場があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B0%8F%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%BA+%28%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E7%9C%8C%29&oldid=110468221"}],"06402":[{"id":"06402:national:666efe57e4c9","cityId":"06402","category":"地域","text":"白鷹町の中央には、最上川が南北に流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%99%BD%E9%B7%B9%E7%94%BA&oldid=110802938"}],"06403":[{"id":"06403:national:20f21723cb46","cityId":"06403","category":"地理・自然","text":"飯豊町には飯豊山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%A3%AF%E8%B1%8A%E7%94%BA&oldid=110468234"},{"id":"06403:national:fbece0fe1377","cityId":"06403","category":"地理・自然","text":"飯豊町には天狗山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%A3%AF%E8%B1%8A%E7%94%BA&oldid=110468234"}],"06426":[{"id":"06426:national:bf11d5e86ca5","cityId":"06426","category":"地理・自然","text":"三川町には藤島川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA&oldid=110802927"},{"id":"06426:national:b342ecdcc6ab","cityId":"06426","category":"地理・自然","text":"三川町には大山川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA&oldid=110802927"}],"06428":[{"id":"06428:national:023d0064c0d1","cityId":"06428","category":"地理・自然","text":"庄内町には最上川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BA%84%E5%86%85%E7%94%BA&oldid=110802914"},{"id":"06428:national:940925554690","cityId":"06428","category":"地理・自然","text":"庄内町には立谷沢川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BA%84%E5%86%85%E7%94%BA&oldid=110802914"}],"06461":[{"id":"06461:national:3b26cc92e2ae","cityId":"06461","category":"地理・自然","text":"遊佐町は山形県にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%81%8A%E4%BD%90%E7%94%BA&oldid=110870633"}]}}
